e\nURL: https://www.irs.gov/irm/part21/irm_21-006-004r\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\n1. Purpose: This IRM provides information on computing tax, inclusions in tax, and determining deductions allowed before the tax is computed. The following subjects are covered in this chapter:\n...\n3. If a fraudulent claim is identified that does not have"
